{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24910","headline":"东都父老望幸 · 薛存诚","name":"东都父老望幸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"銮舆秦地久，羽卫洛阳空。\n彼土虽凭固，兹川乃得中。\n龙颜觐白日，鹤发仰清风。\n望幸诚逾邈，怀来意不穷。\n昔因封泰岳，今伫蹑维嵩。\n天地心无异，神只理亦同。\n翠华翔渭北，玉检候关东。\n衆愿其难阻，明君早勒功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛存诚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}